! mcp_bootstrap_p365.strap -- MCP printed page 365: the SYSTEM COMMAND
! package's COMMAND EXIT ROUTINE (Z ER EX1/Z ER EX2 error exits, Z EXITX
! command-accepted exit, Z EXIT and the normal-return entry J NCPX /
! J FINX), its two error messages and the command-name list Z LIST.
!
! docs/MCP_Mar63_250-445.pdf PDF p.115, read at 400 dpi, data rows and
! doubtful glyphs at 900 dpi.  Header, READ: "TIME CLOCK 00054041  PUNID
! 22SCOMD  CARD ID WA000192  DIST. OF 3/01  3/01  PAGE NUMBER 365".  The
! heading row's LOCATION field is BLANK.
!
! THE PAGE.  47 lines, every line number prints a "*"; "*" after the
! LOCATION on lines 15, 35 and 44.  No TAIL; still PUNID 22SCOMD, card
! series WA, no SLC printed.
!   lines  1-3   remarks: banner "*****COMMAND EXIT ROUTINE*****" on 2.
!   lines  4-15  code, 234630.40 .. 234635.40, then J ERZ DRZ(BU,64),1
!                at 234636.00 (prints 000001.00).
!   lines 16-17  remarks: "ENTRY FOR NORMAL RETURN" on 17.
!   lines 18-21  J NCPX SYN,$ (234637.00+ "+00000000 NULL"), J FINX
!                TI and the BE,D MCP / ,D RET pair.
!   lines 22-33  three VF/CF pairs and the two (IQS*) error messages.
!   lines 34-47  Z LIST X (one 32-character message) and Z LIST, eleven
!                one-word (IQS*) command names, 234656.00 .. 234670.00.
! The page ends with line 47's word at 234670.00 (next 234671.00 = JOUTP,
! p.361's JTABL target, so p.366 should open there).
! JOIN: line 4's CNOP at 234630.40 continues p.364 (not landed; the
! coordinator checks p.364's last location).
!
! DATA BLANKS (entry mode, no binary printed): counted on a 39.8 px
! (400 dpi) character ruler and each confirmed by the next card's
! LOCATION and by the CF word counts: line 29 = 16 characters (2 words;
! CF,2.0), line 30 = 32 (4 words; CF,4.0), line 35 = 9 blanks +
! "COMMAND ACCEPTED." + 6 blanks = 32 (4 words; CF,4.0; the CNOP then
! advances nothing), lines 37-47 = 8 characters each, right-justified.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
!   * "DC(BU)" on lines 29, 30, 35, 37-42, 44, 46, 47 = DD (D with its
!     stem worn; lines 43 and 45 print DD plainly).
!   * line 37 "OUTPLT" = OUTPUT: at 900 dpi both U's print a faint
!     dotted right stem (worn U, not L); p.361's JLIST names OUTPUT.
!   * line 46 "ABECJ" = ABEOJ (open O), as p.361's JLIST line 23 and the
!     landed ,DABEOJ (p.333).  Lines 38-39 "EOF"/"EOJ", 42 "IOCHANGE",
!     47 "COMMENT" also print the O open.
!   * line 5 "Z ER EXI"/"ZEXI" read as ZEREX1 / ZEX1: line 23 defines
!     Z EX1 at 234641.00, which line 5's binary 234641.30 addresses;
!     C22-6728 names ZEREX1, ZEREX2, ZEXITX, JHARD, JNCPX, JFINX.
!   * line 23 "Z EX 11", line 26 "Z EX 21": blanks in a name, = ZEX11,
!     ZEX21 (lines 29, 30 define them at the printed 234643.00/234645.00).
!   * hex bytes "CO"/"C0" (lines 4, 6, 8, 13, 20) = 00: the octal fields
!     of the same rows print 0 open (lesson 6).  Line 4's "C0" is CNOP's.
!   * line 27 prints a small raised tick after "CF,4.0" -- paper/ink
!     speck, not a "." (it sits above the baseline).
!   * line 40's raised tick before REWIND is a speck (8 characters with
!     two blanks fits the LOCATIONs).
!
! EXTERNALS.  JHARD, JSTLR: not landed; from this page's binary (B prints
! the address + .10, half word only; TI's first address, word).  DMCP,
! DCOMM, DRET: landed p.105/p.108.  $X0 is the system symbol (index
! register 0, 16.0 -- TI prints 000020.00).
!
! CARD SERIALS.  WA000192 .. WA000238, one per line, none shared or
! skipped.

JHARD   SYN, (8)234575.40            ! not landed; B lines 6, 8 print 234575.50, half word only
JSTLR   SYN, (8)234530.0             ! not landed; TI line 19 prints 234530.00
DMCP    SYN, 32.0                    ! landed p.108 "D MCP SYN,32.0"; BE lines 13, 20 000040.00
DCOMM   SYN, 35.32                   ! landed p.105 line 23; line 14 000043.40
DRET    SYN, 33.0                    ! landed p.105; line 21 000041.00

        SLC, (8)234630.40
! line  1  -
! line  2  -         *****COMMAND EXIT ROUTINE*****
! line  3  -
        CNOP                                                 ! line  4
ZEREX1  LX,12,ZEX1                                           ! line  5
        B,JHARD                                              ! line  6
ZEREX2  LX,12,ZEX2                                           ! line  7
        B,JHARD                                              ! line  8
ZEXITX  LWF(U),ZLIST($12)                                    ! line  9
        LX,12,ZLISTC                                         ! line 10
        ST(U),ZLISTX                                         ! line 11
ZEXIT   SX,12,JERZ                                           ! line 12
        BE,DMCP                                              ! line 13
        ,DCOMM                                               ! line 14
JERZ    DRZ(BU,64),1                                         ! line 15
! line 16  -
! line 17  -         ENTRY FOR NORMAL RETURN
JNOPX   SYN,$                                                ! line 18  (printed "JNCPX": open O; pp.366-376 print it, lines 26/46 of p.376 closed, and C22-6728 sets JNOPX)
JFINX   TI,16,JSTLR,$X0                                      ! line 19  -RESTORE INDEX REGISTERS
        BE,DMCP                                              ! line 20
        ,DRET                                                ! line 21
        CNOP                                                 ! line 22
ZEX1    VF,ZEX11                                             ! line 23
        CF,2.0                                               ! line 24
        CNOP                                                 ! line 25
ZEX2    VF,ZEX21                                             ! line 26
        CF,4.0                                               ! line 27
        CNOP                                                 ! line 28
ZEX11   (IQS*)DD(BU),ILLEGAL COMMAND *                       ! line 29
ZEX21   (IQS*)DD(BU),LEGAL COMMAND, ILLEGAL SITUATION*       ! line 30
        CNOP                                                 ! line 31
ZLISTC  VF,ZLISTX                                            ! line 32
        CF,4.0                                               ! line 33
        CNOP                                                 ! line 34
ZLISTX  (IQS*)DD(BU),         COMMAND ACCEPTED.      *       ! line 35
        CNOP                                                 ! line 36
ZLIST   (IQS*)DD(BU),  OUTPUT*                               ! line 37  printed "OUTPLT" (worn U)
        (IQS*)DD(BU),     EOF*                               ! line 38
        (IQS*)DD(BU),     EOJ*                               ! line 39
        (IQS*)DD(BU),  REWIND*                               ! line 40
        (IQS*)DD(BU),  REJECT*                               ! line 41
        (IQS*)DD(BU),IOCHANGE*                               ! line 42
        (IQS*)DD(BU),  BYPASS*                               ! line 43
        (IQS*)DD(BU),  ONLINE*                               ! line 44
        (IQS*)DD(BU), OFFLINE*                               ! line 45
        (IQS*)DD(BU),   ABEOJ*                               ! line 46  printed "ABECJ" (open O)
        (IQS*)DD(BU), COMMENT*                               ! line 47

! line 18 prints "234637.00+  +00000000  NULL  JNCPX SYN,$" (no word).
! line 15 prints 000001.00 (the DRZ count), not a word -- no !CHECK.

!SYM ZEREX1 234631.00
!SYM ZEREX2 234632.00
!SYM ZEXITX 234633.00
!SYM ZEXIT  234634.40
!SYM JERZ   234636.00
!SYM JNOPX  234637.00
!SYM JFINX  234637.00
!SYM ZEX1   234641.00
!SYM ZEX2   234642.00
!SYM ZEX11  234643.00
!SYM ZEX21  234645.00
!SYM ZLISTC 234651.00
!SYM ZLISTX 234652.00
!SYM ZLIST  234656.00
!CHECK 234630.40 | 000000.30 00 | line 4 CNOP (hex prints "C0" = 00, lesson 6)
!CHECK 234631.00 | 234641.30 10 | line 5 Z ER EX1 LX,12,ZEX1
!CHECK 234631.40 | 234575.50 00 | line 6 B,J HARD (hex prints "C0")
!CHECK 234632.00 | 234642.30 10 | line 7 Z ER EX2 LX,12,ZEX2
!CHECK 234632.40 | 234575.50 00 | line 8 B,J HARD
!CHECK 234633.00 | 234656.42 6C | line 9 Z EXITX LWF(U),Z LIST($12)
!CHECK 234633.40 | 234651.30 10 | line 10 LX,12,Z LISTC
!CHECK 234634.00 | 234652.40 E0 | line 11 ST(U),Z LISTX
!CHECK 234634.40 | 234636.31 10 | line 12 Z EXIT SX,12,J ERZ
!CHECK 234635.00 | 000040.00 00 | line 13 BE,D MCP
!CHECK 234635.40 | 000043.40 80 | line 14 ,D COMM
!CHECK 234637.00 | 234530.00 80 000020.00 A0 | line 19 J FINX TI,16,JSTLR,$X0
!CHECK 234640.00 | 000040.00 00 | line 20 BE,D MCP (hex prints "C0" = 00)
!CHECK 234640.40 | 000041.00 80 | line 21 ,D RET
!CHECK 234641.00 | 234643.00+ | line 23 Z EX1 VF,Z EX 11
!CHECK 234641.40 | 000002 | line 24 CF,2.0 (prints "CC0002")
!CHECK 234642.00 | 234645.00+ | line 26 Z EX2 VF,Z EX 21
!CHECK 234642.40 | 000004 | line 27 CF,4.0 (prints "CC0004")
!CHECK 234651.00 | 234652.00+ | line 32 Z LISTC VF,Z LISTX
!CHECK 234651.40 | 000004 | line 33 CF,4.0
